c) For a combined system: \(R_S(t) = \prod_{\text{Series Stages}} \prod_{i=1}^n R_i(t) \cdot \prod_{\text{Parallel Stages}} \left[1 - \prod_{i=1}^n (1 - R_i(t))\right) \).
