   \( \text{Total mice} - \text{optical mice} - \text{trackwell mugs} = \text{wireless mice} \)  
   \( 80 - 20 - 20 = 40 \)

3. **Calculate the ratio of wireless mice to total mice:**  
   \( \frac{\text{Wireless mice}}{\text{Total mice}} = \frac{40}{80} = \frac{1}{2} \)

