\[
\text{Decay Length} = \frac{\lambda}{n_{\text{eff}} - n_f} \approx \frac{1 \times 10^{-6} \text{ m}}{0.3} \approx 3.33 \times 10^{-6} \text{ m} = 3.33 \mu m
\]

