   \text{Percentage change} = \left( \frac{A_{vf}' - A_{vf}}{A_{vf}} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{7.61 - 9.09}{9.09} \right) \times 100 = \left( \frac{-1.48}{9.09} \right) \times 100 \approx -16.3\%
