\]
Rearranging the equation, we get:
\[
\phi_j^{n+1} + \frac{\Delta t}{\Delta x}^2 \phi_j^{n+1} = \phi_j^{n-1} + \frac{2\kappa \Delta t}{(\Delta x)^2} \left( \phi_{j+1}^n - \phi_{j-1}^n \right).
\]
This can be rewritten as:
\[
